"трайност`, :guilabel:`Дата за премахване` и :guilabel:`Дата за "
"предупреждение`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:115
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Inventory` tab of the product, `Egg`, the "
