"бутон :guilabel:`Партиди/Серийни номера` във формуляра на продукта."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:142
msgid ""
"Show expiration dates from the Lots/Serial Numbers list on the product form."
msgstr ""
"Покажете сроковете на годност от списъка „Партиди/Серийни номера“ във "
"формуляра на продукта."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:148
msgid ""
"Using the :abbr:`FEFO (First Expired, First Out)` removal strategy ensures "
"that products with the nearest removal date are picked first."
