":guilabel:`Dutiable Material`: Enable this option if the shipping method is "
"liable to customs or other duties."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Dutiable Material`: активирайте тази опция, ако методът за "
"доставка подлежи на мита или други такси."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:122
msgid "Turn on the DHL Connection"
msgstr "Активиране на връзката с DHL"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:124
msgid ""
"Once the DHL connection is set up, use the smart buttons at the top of the "
"form to publish, turn on production mode, or activate debug logging."
msgstr ""
"След като връзката с DHL е настроена, използвайте интелигентните бутони в "
"горната част на формуляра, за да публикувате, да включите производствен "
"режим или да активирате логване за отстраняване на грешки."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:127
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Unpublished`/:guilabel:`Published`: Determines if this shipping "
"method is available on the user's **eCommerce** website."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Unpublished`/:guilabel:`Published`: определя дали този метод за "
"доставка е наличен на уебсайта на потребителя за **eCommerce**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:130
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Test Environment`/:guilabel:`Production Environment`: Determines "
"whether label creation is for testing and canceled immediately (Test) or "
"generates a real shipping label that is charged to the DHL account "
"(Production)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Test Environment`/:guilabel:`Production Environment`: определя "
"дали създаването на етикет е за тестване и се отменя веднага (Test), или "
"генерира истински етикет за доставка, който се таксува към акаунта в DHL "
"(Production)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:133
msgid ""
":guilabel:`No Debug`/:guilabel:`Debug Requests`: Determines whether API "
"requests and responses are logged in Odoo (turn on :ref:`developer mode "
"<developer-mode>` and go to :menuselection:`Settings app --> Technical --> "
"Logging`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`No Debug`/:guilabel:`Debug Requests`: определя дали заявките и "
"отговорите на API се записват в дневник в Odoo (включете :ref:`режим на "
"разработчик <developer-mode>` и отидете на :menuselection:`Settings app --> "
"Technical --> Logging`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:3
msgid "Dispatch management system"
msgstr "Система за управление на диспечирането"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:10
msgid ""
"The *dispatch management system* feature in Odoo is used to plan and build "
"shipments. Key features include:"
msgstr ""
"Функцията *система за управление на диспечирането* в Odoo се използва за "
"планиране и изграждане на пратки. Основните функции включват:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:13
msgid ""
"**Load building**: Group products for specific carriers, assign "
"those :doc:`batches <../picking_methods/batch>` to loading docks, and manage "
"vehicle assignments based on fleet capacity. This ensures the right products "
"are packed into the appropriate trucks for delivery."
msgstr ""
"**Изграждане на товар**: групирайте продукти за конкретни превозвачи, "
"назначете тези :doc:`партиди <../picking_methods/batch>` към товарни рампи и "
"управлявайте назначенията на превозни средства въз основа на капацитета на "
"автопарка. Това гарантира, че правилните продукти се товарят в подходящите "
"камиони за доставка."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:16
msgid ""
":doc:`Fleet management <../../../../hr/fleet>`: Track and manage the "
"capacity of in-house delivery vehicles."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Управление на автопарк <../../../../hr/fleet>`: проследявайте и "
"управлявайте капацитета на собствените превозни средства за доставка."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:22
msgid ""
"To use the dispatch management system, the following setup must be completed:"
msgstr ""
"За да използвате системата за управление на диспечирането, трябва да "
"завършите следната настройка:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:24
msgid ":ref:`Install <general/install>` the **Fleet** application."
msgstr ":ref:`Инсталирайте <general/install>` приложението **Fleet**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:25
msgid ""
"Enable :ref:`necessary features <inventory/shipping_receiving/inventory-"
"features>` in the **Inventory** app."
msgstr ""
"Активирайте :ref:`необходимите функции <inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"inventory-features>` в приложението **Inventory**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:27
msgid ""
"Enable and configure the :ref:`Mapbox integration <general/integrations/"
"geolocation-routes>`."
msgstr ""
"Активирайте и конфигурирайте :ref:`интеграцията с Mapbox <general/"
"integrations/geolocation-routes>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:28
msgid ""
"Configure vehicle :ref:`capacity (volume and weight) <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/vehicle-capacity>`."
msgstr ""
"Конфигурирайте :ref:`капацитета (обем и тегло) <inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"vehicle-capacity>` на превозното средство."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:30
msgid "Enter vehicle :doc:`car models <../../../../hr/fleet/models>`."
msgstr ""
"Въведете :doc:`модели автомобили <../../../../hr/fleet/models>` за "
"превозните средства."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:31
msgid ""
"Set up :ref:`vehicles as delivery methods <inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"delivery-method-for-carrier>`."
msgstr ""
"Настройте :ref:`превозни средства като методи за доставка <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/delivery-method-for-carrier>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:33
msgid "Create :ref:`dock locations <inventory/shipping_receiving/docks>`."
msgstr ""
"Създайте :ref:`локации на товарни рампи <inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"docks>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:36
msgid ""
"Dispatch management can evaluate capacity on a vehicle **only** if a weight "
"and volume are assigned to a product on the *Inventory* tab of its product "
"form."
msgstr ""
"Управлението на изпращанията може да оцени капацитета на превозно средство "
"**само** ако на продукта са зададени тегло и обем в раздела *Инвентар* на "
"неговата форма."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:42
msgid "Inventory settings"
msgstr "Настройки на Inventory"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:44
msgid ""
"To set the required inventory settings, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Settings`."
msgstr ""
"За да зададете необходимите настройки за инвентара, отидете "
"на :menuselection:`Инвентар --> Конфигурация --> Настройки`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:47
msgid ""
"In the *Operations* section, select the :guilabel:`Batch, Wave & Cluster "
"Transfers` checkbox to prepare batches of orders for delivery."
msgstr ""
"В секцията *Операции* отметнете :guilabel:`Партидни, вълнови и клъстерни "
"прехвърляния`, за да подготвяте партиди от поръчки за доставка."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:50
msgid ""
"In the *Shipping* section, select the :guilabel:`Delivery Methods` "
"and :guilabel:`Transport Management` checkboxes. Doing so allows specific "
"vehicles to be :ref:`set as carriers <inventory/shipping_receiving/delivery-"
"method-for-carrier>`."
msgstr ""
"В раздела *Доставка* поставете отметки за :guilabel:`Методи на доставка` "
"и :guilabel:`Управление на транспорта`. Това позволява конкретни превозни "
"средства да :ref:`бъдат зададени като превозвачи <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/delivery-method-for-carrier>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:54
msgid "Set delivery and transport settings in the Inventory configuration."
msgstr "Задайте настройки за доставка и транспорт в конфигурацията на „Склад“."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:57
msgid ""
"In the *Warehouse* section, select the :guilabel:`Storage Locations` "
"checkbox to assign specific locations in the warehouse as loading zones for "
"delivery trucks."
msgstr ""
"В секцията *Склад* отметнете :guilabel:`Локация за съхранение`, за да "
"определите конкретни локации в склада като зони за товарене на камионите за "
"доставка."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:60
msgid ""
"Once all the configurations are complete, be sure to click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"След като всички конфигурации приключат, не забравяйте да щракнете "
"върху :guilabel:`Запазване`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:62
msgid ""
"Then, enable and configure the :ref:`Mapbox integration <general/"
"integrations/geolocation-routes>` to be able to create :ref:`delivery routes "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/delivery-route>`."
msgstr ""
"След това активирайте и конфигурирайте :ref:`интеграцията с Mapbox <general/"
"integrations/geolocation-routes>`, за да можете да създавате :ref:`маршрути "
"за доставка <inventory/shipping_receiving/delivery-route>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:68
msgid "Vehicle capacity"
msgstr "Капацитет на превозното средство"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:70
msgid ""
"To configure the vehicle capacity, go to :menuselection:`Fleet app --> "
"Configuration --> Categories`."
msgstr ""
"За да конфигурирате капацитета на превозното средство, отидете "
"на :menuselection:`Fleet app --> Configuration --> Categories`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:73
msgid ""
"Next, click :guilabel:`New` to add a new category, or click into an existing "
"category to modify it. In the :guilabel:`Name` field, enter the type of "
"vehicle (e.g., `Pick-up truck`, `Van`, or `Cargo truck`). Then, enter the "
"vehicle capacity in the :guilabel:`Max Weight` (in kilograms) "
"and :guilabel:`Max Volume` (in cubic meters) fields."
msgstr ""
"След това кликнете върху :guilabel:`New`, за да добавите нова категория, или "
"кликнете върху съществуваща категория, за да я промените. В "
"полето :guilabel:`Name` въведете типа на превозното средство (напр. `Pick-up "
"truck`, `Van` или `Cargo truck`). След това въведете капацитета на "
"превозното средство в полетата :guilabel:`Max Weight` (в килограми) "
"и :guilabel:`Max Volume` (в кубични метри)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:79
msgid "Vehicle categories with defined weight and volume."
msgstr "Категории превозни средства с определени тегло и обем."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:83
msgid ""
"The units of measurement for vehicle capacity are assigned at the global "
"level in the **Settings** app, in the :guilabel:`Units of Measure` section."
msgstr ""
"Мерните единици за капацитета на превозното средство се задават на глобално "
"ниво в приложението **Settings**, в раздела :guilabel:`Units of Measure`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:86
msgid "Show units of measure settings."
msgstr "Показва настройките за мерни единици."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:90
msgid ":ref:`Vehicle category <fleet/categories>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Категория на превозно средство <fleet/categories>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:94
msgid "Car model"
msgstr "Модел автомобил"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:96
msgid ""
"Configuring a vehicle's car model is required when adding vehicles in Odoo. "
"Ensure the correct *Category* is selected for a car model. Doing so "
"automatically applies weight and volume capacities to all vehicles of that "
"type."
msgstr ""
"Конфигурирането на модела на автомобила на превозно средство е задължително "
"при добавяне на превозни средства в Odoo. Уверете се, че за модела автомобил "
"е избрана правилната *Category*. Това автоматично прилага капацитетите на "
"тегло и обем за всички превозни средства от този тип."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:100
msgid ""
"To configure, navigate to :menuselection:`Fleet app --> Configuration --> "
"Models`."
msgstr ""
"За да конфигурирате, отидете на :menuselection:`Fleet app --> Configuration "
"--> Models`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:102
msgid ""
"From the :guilabel:`Models` list, select an existing model, or "
"click :guilabel:`New` in the top-left corner to create a new model. Then, "
"set the relevant :guilabel:`Category` field to the relevant vehicle category."
msgstr ""
"От списъка :guilabel:`Models` изберете съществуващ модел или кликнете "
"върху :guilabel:`New` в горния ляв ъгъл, за да създадете нов модел. След "
"това задайте съответното поле :guilabel:`Category` на подходящата категория "
"превозно средство."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:107
msgid ":doc:`Create car model <../../../../hr/fleet/models>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Създаване на модел автомобил <../../../../hr/fleet/models>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:112
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/third_party_shipper.rst:92
msgid "Delivery method"
msgstr "Метод за доставка"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:114
msgid ""
"Optionally, delivery vehicles can be assigned as a delivery method *carrier*."
msgstr ""
"По желание превозните средства за доставка могат да бъдат зададени като "
"*превозвач* в метод на доставка."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:116
msgid ""
"To configure delivery methods, go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Configuration --> Delivery Methods`. Select an existing delivery method, or "
"click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"За да конфигурирате методи за доставка, отидете на :menuselection:`Inventory "
"app --> Configuration --> Delivery Methods`. Изберете съществуващ метод за "
"доставка или кликнете върху :guilabel:`New`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:120
msgid ":doc:`Configure delivery method <../setup_configuration>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Конфигуриране на метод за доставка <../setup_configuration>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:122
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Delivery Method` form, enter a name for the delivery "
"method. It is recommended to use identifying information, such as the "
"vehicle description and license plate number (e.g. `Truck 123-ABCD`)."
msgstr ""
"Във формуляра :guilabel:`Delivery Method` въведете име за метода на "
"доставка. Препоръчва се да използвате идентифицираща информация, като "
"описание на превозното средство и регистрационен номер (напр. `Truck 123-"
"ABCD`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:126
msgid ""
"Since the delivery methods are managed internally, set "
"the :guilabel:`Provider` to either :guilabel:`Fixed Price` "
"or :guilabel:`Based on Rules`. For more information about how shipping "
"prices are calculated, refer to the :doc:`Delivery method <../"
"setup_configuration>` article."
msgstr ""
"Тъй като методите за доставка се управляват вътрешно, "
"задайте :guilabel:`Доставчик` на :guilabel:`Фиксирана цена` "
"или :guilabel:`На база правила`. За повече информация как се изчисляват "
"цените за доставка, вижте статията :doc:`Метод на доставка <../"
"setup_configuration>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:130
msgid ""
"Next, set a :guilabel:`Delivery Product`, which is the product that shows up "
"as the customer's :ref:`delivery charge <inventory/shipping/sales-order>` on "
"the sales order or invoice."
msgstr ""
"След това задайте :guilabel:`Продукт за доставка` — продуктът, който се "
"показва на клиента като :ref:`такса за доставка <inventory/shipping/sales-"
"order>` в поръчката за продажба или фактурата."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:133
msgid ""
"Optionally, in the :guilabel:`Availability` tab, set "
"the :guilabel:`Countries`, :guilabel:`States`, or :guilabel:`Zip Prefixes` "
"to limit the range of local delivery."
msgstr ""
"По желание, в раздела :guilabel:`Наличност`, "
"задайте :guilabel:`Държави`, :guilabel:`Области` или :guilabel:`Представки "
"на пощенски кодове`, за да ограничите обхвата на локалната доставка."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:136
msgid ""
"Example delivery method with the Zip Prefixes set to San Francisco's zip "
"code."
msgstr ""
"Примерен метод на доставка с Пощенски префикси, зададени на пощенския код на "
"Сан Франциско."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:142
msgid "Dock locations"
msgstr "Локации на рампи"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:144
msgid ""
"Each loading dock must have a dedicated location. To create dock locations, "
"go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Locations` and "
"click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"Всяка товарна рампа трябва да има отделна локация. За да създадете локации "
"на рампи, отидете на :menuselection:`Инвентар --> Конфигурация --> Локации` "
"и щракнете върху :guilabel:`Нов`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:147
msgid ""
"After dock locations are set up in Odoo, configure them in the operation "
"type. Navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> "
"Operations Types` and open an existing delivery operation type, or "
"click :guilabel:`New` to create a new one."
msgstr ""
"След като локациите на рампите са настроени в Odoo, конфигурирайте ги във "
"вида операция. Отидете на :menuselection:`Инвентар --> Конфигурация --> "
"Видове операции` и отворете съществуващ вид операция за доставка или "
"щракнете върху :guilabel:`Нов`, за да създадете нов."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:151
msgid ""
"After defining the other fields in the operation type form, scroll to the "
"*Batch & wave transfers* section and select the :guilabel:`Dispatch "
"Management` checkbox. The :guilabel:`Dock locations` field appears. Define "
"the dock locations for this operation type."
msgstr ""
"След като дефинирате останалите полета във формата на вида операция, "
"превъртете до секцията *Партидни и вълнови прехвърляния* и "
"отметнете :guilabel:`Управление на изпращанията`. Появява се "
"полето :guilabel:`Локации на рампи`. Дефинирайте локациите на рампите за "
"този вид операция."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:155
msgid "Location configuration."
msgstr "Конфигуриране на локация."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:163
msgid "Build loads"
msgstr "Изграждане на товари"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:165
msgid ""
"After setup is complete, optionally :ref:`assign orders to a carrier "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/assign-carrier>` and :ref:`group them into "
