msgstr ":guilabel:`Продукт за доставка`: `[SHIP] Flat`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:116
msgid "Example of filling out a shipping method."
msgstr "Пример за попълване на метод за доставка."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:122
msgid "Based on rules"
msgstr "На база правила"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:124
msgid ""
"To calculate the price of shipping based on pricing rules, set "
"the :guilabel:`Provider` field to the :guilabel:`Based on Rules` option. "
"Optionally, adjust :guilabel:`Margin on Rate` and :guilabel:`Additional "
"margin` to include additional shipping costs."
msgstr ""
"За да изчислите цената на доставката въз основа на ценови правила, задайте "
"полето :guilabel:`Доставчик` на опцията :guilabel:`На база правила`. По "
"желание коригирайте :guilabel:`Марж върху тарифата` "
"и :guilabel:`Допълнителен марж`, за да включите допълнителни разходи за "
"доставка."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:129
msgid "Create pricing rules"
msgstr "Създаване на ценови правила"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:131
msgid ""
"Navigate to the :guilabel:`Pricing` tab and click :guilabel:`Add a line`. "
"Doing so opens the :guilabel:`Create Pricing Rules` window, where "
"the :guilabel:`Condition` related to the product weight, volume, price, or "
"quantity is compared to a defined amount to calculate "
"the :guilabel:`Delivery Cost`."
msgstr ""
"Отидете в раздела :guilabel:`Ценообразуване` и щракнете "
"върху :guilabel:`Добавяне на ред`. Това отваря "
"прозореца :guilabel:`Създаване на ценови правила`, "
"където :guilabel:`Условие`, свързано с теглото, обема, цената или "
"количеството на продукта, се сравнява с определена стойност, за да се "
"изчисли :guilabel:`Разход за доставка`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:136
msgid ""
"Once finished, click either :guilabel:`Save & New` to add another rule, "
"or :guilabel:`Save & Close`."
msgstr ""
"След като приключите, щракнете върху :guilabel:`Запазване и ново`, за да "
"добавите друго правило, или върху :guilabel:`Запазване и затваряне`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:139
msgid ""
"To charge customers $20 in shipping for orders with five or fewer products, "
"set the :guilabel:`Condition` to `Quantity <= 5.00`, and "
"the :guilabel:`Delivery Cost` to `$20`."
msgstr ""
"За да таксувате клиентите с $20 за доставка на поръчки с пет или по-малко "
"продукта, задайте :guilabel:`Условие` на `Quantity <= 5.00`, "
"а :guilabel:`Разход за доставка` на `$20`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:142
msgid ""
"Display window to add a pricing rule. Set a condition and delivery cost."
msgstr ""
"Прозорец за добавяне на ценово правило. Задаване на условие и разход за "
"доставка."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:145
msgid ""
"To restrict shipping to specific destinations on the **eCommerce** website, "
"in the shipping method form, navigate to the :guilabel:`Destination "
"Availability` tab and define the :guilabel:`Countries`, :guilabel:`States`, "
"and :guilabel:`Zip Prefixes`. Leave these fields empty if all locations "
"apply."
msgstr ""
"За да ограничите доставката до конкретни дестинации на уебсайта "
"**eCommerce**, във формуляра на метода за доставка отидете в "
"раздела :guilabel:`Наличност по дестинация` и "
"задайте :guilabel:`Държави`, :guilabel:`Области` и :guilabel:`Пощенски "
"префикси`. Оставете тези полета празни, ако важат за всички местоположения."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:152
msgid "Calculate delivery cost"
msgstr "Изчисляване на разход за доставка"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:154
msgid ""
"Shipping cost is the :guilabel:`Delivery cost` specified in the rule that "
"satisfies the :guilabel:`Condition`, plus any extra charges from "
"the :guilabel:`Margin on rate` and :guilabel:`Additional margin`."
msgstr ""
"Разходът за доставка е :guilabel:`Разход за доставка`, посочен в правилото, "
"което удовлетворява :guilabel:`Условие`, плюс всички допълнителни такси "
"от :guilabel:`Марж върху тарифата` и :guilabel:`Допълнителен марж`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:158
msgid ""
"Total = Rule's~Delivery~Cost + (Margin~on~rate \\times Rule's~Delivery~Cost) "
"+ Additional~margin\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Общо = Разход~за~доставка~на~правилото + (Марж~върху~тарифата \\times "
"Разход~за~доставка~на~правилото) + Допълнителен~марж\n"
"\n"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:162
msgid "With the two following rules set up:"
msgstr "При настроени следните две правила:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:164
msgid "If the order contains five or fewer products, shipping is $20"
msgstr "Ако поръчката съдържа пет или по-малко продукта, доставката е $20"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:165
msgid "If the order contains more than five products, shipping is $50."
msgstr "Ако поръчката съдържа повече от пет продукта, доставката е $50."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:167
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Margin on Rate` is `10%` and :guilabel:`Additional margin` is "
"`$9.00`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Марж върху тарифата` е `10%`, а :guilabel:`Допълнителен марж` е "
"`$9.00`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:169
msgid ""
"Show example of \"Based on rules\" shipping method with margins configured."
msgstr ""
"Показване на пример за метод за доставка „На база правила“ с конфигурирани "
"маржове."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:172
msgid ""
"When the first rule is applied, the delivery cost is $31 (20 + (0.1 * 20) + "
"9). When the second rule is applied, the delivery cost is $64 (50 + (0.1 * "
"50) + 9)."
msgstr ""
"Когато се приложи първото правило, разходът за доставка е $31 (20 + (0.1 * "
"20) + 9). Когато се приложи второто правило, разходът за доставка е $64 (50 "
"+ (0.1 * 50) + 9)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:178
msgid "Route on shipping method"
msgstr "Маршрут на метод за доставка"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:180
msgid ""
"Optionally, set different warehouse delivery processes for a shipping method "
"by configuring different :doc:`routes <../daily_operations/use_routes>` for "
"it."
msgstr ""
"По желание можете да зададете различни процеси на доставка от склада за "
"даден метод на доставка, като конфигурирате различни :doc:`маршрути <../"
"daily_operations/use_routes>` за него."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:184
msgid ""
"Configuring multiple routes per shipping method is helpful for adjusting "
"warehouse delivery processes based on:"
msgstr ""
"Конфигурирането на няколко маршрута за метод на доставка е полезно за "
"адаптиране на процесите на доставка от склада въз основа на:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:187
msgid ""
"speed (e.g., use :doc:`one-step delivery <../daily_operations/"
"receipts_delivery_one_step>` for express shipping, or :doc:`two-step <../"
"daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps>` for standard shipping)."
msgstr ""
"скорост (напр. използвайте :doc:`едностъпкова доставка <../daily_operations/"
"receipts_delivery_one_step>` за експресна доставка или :doc:`двустъпкова <../"
"daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps>` за стандартна доставка)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:190
msgid ""
"international shipping (e.g. use :doc:`three-step delivery <../"
"daily_operations/delivery_three_steps>` to prepare documents for customs)"
msgstr ""
"международна доставка (напр. използвайте :doc:`тристъпкова доставка <../"
"daily_operations/delivery_three_steps>`, за да подготвите документи за "
"митницата)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:192
msgid ""
"in-store pickup or home delivery: ship from the central warehouse, or pick "
"from the store's stock, depending on customer selection."
msgstr ""
"получаване от магазина или доставка до дома: изпращане от централния склад "
"или вземане от наличността на магазина, в зависимост от избора на клиента."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:195
msgid ""
"To set up routes, go to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> "
"Routes`. Click :guilabel:`New`, or select the desired route."
msgstr ""
"За да настроите маршрути, отидете на :menuselection:`Склад --> Конфигуриране "
"--> Маршрути`. Щракнете върху :guilabel:`Ново` или изберете желания маршрут."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:198
msgid ""
"On the route form, in the :guilabel:`Applicable On` section, tick "
"the :guilabel:`Shipping Methods` checkbox."
msgstr ""
"Във формуляра за маршрута, в раздела :guilabel:`Приложимо за`, отметнете "
"квадратчето :guilabel:`Методи за доставка`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:201
msgid "Routes form with the Shipping Methods checkbox selected."
msgstr "Формуляр за маршрути с отметнато квадратче Методи за доставка."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:204
msgid "Routes form with the :guilabel:`Shipping Method` checkbox ticked."
msgstr ""
"Формуляр за маршрути с отметнато квадратче :guilabel:`Метод за доставка`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:206
msgid ""
"Then, go to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Delivery "
"Methods`, and select the desired shipping method."
msgstr ""
"След това отидете на :menuselection:`Склад --> Конфигуриране --> Методи за "
"доставка` и изберете желания метод за доставка."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:209
msgid ""
"On the shipping method form, in the :guilabel:`Routes` field, select the "
"available fulfillment routes from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Във формуляра на метода за доставка, в полето :guilabel:`Маршрути`, изберете "
"наличните маршрути за изпълнение от падащото меню."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:213
msgid ""
"If the desired route is not selectable, check that the *Shipping Methods* "
"option is enabled in the route's *Applicable On* section."
msgstr ""
"Ако желаният маршрут не може да бъде избран, проверете дали опцията *Методи "
"за доставка* е активирана в раздела *Приложимо за* на маршрута."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:216
msgid "Show set routes on shipping method form."
msgstr "Показване на зададени маршрути във формуляра за метод на доставка."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:3
