"package in Odoo. This means if a package is created, the configured "
"Sendcloud account will be charged, unless the associated package is "
"cancelled within 24 hours of creation."
msgstr ""
"Sendcloud не предоставя тестови ключове, когато фирма тества изпращането на "
"пратка в Odoo. Това означава, че ако бъде създадена пратка, конфигурираният "
"акаунт в Sendcloud ще бъде таксуван, освен ако свързаната пратка не бъде "
"отменена в рамките на 24 часа от създаването ѝ."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:248
msgid ""
"Odoo has a built-in layer of protection against unwanted charges when using "
"test environments. Within a test environment, if a shipping method is used "
"to create labels, then those labels are immediately cancelled after the "
"creation — this occurs automatically. The test and production environment "
"settings can be toggled back and forth from their respective smart buttons."
msgstr ""
"Odoo разполага с вградено ниво на защита срещу нежелани такси при използване "
"на тестови среди. В тестова среда, ако метод за доставка се използва за "
"създаване на етикети, тези етикети незабавно се отменят след създаването им "
"— това се случва автоматично. Настройките за тестова и продукционна среда "
"могат да се превключват от съответните им интелигентни бутони."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:258
msgid ""
"To use Sendcloud to generate shipping labels, the following information "
"**must** be filled out accurately and completely in Odoo:"
msgstr ""
"За да използвате Sendcloud за генериране на етикети за доставка, следната "
"информация **трябва** да бъде попълнена точно и изцяло в Odoo:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:268
msgid ""
"**Product weight**: Ensure all products in an order have a "
"specified :guilabel:`Weight` in the :guilabel:`Inventory` tab of their "
"product form. Refer to the :ref:`Product weight section <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/configure-weight>` of this article for detailed "
"instructions."
msgstr ""
"**Тегло на продукта**: уверете се, че всички продукти в поръчката имат "
"посочено :guilabel:`Weight` в раздела :guilabel:`Inventory` на формуляра на "
"продукта. Вижте раздела :ref:`Тегло на продукта <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/configure-weight>` от тази статия за подробни инструкции."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:272
msgid ""
"**Warehouse address**: Ensure the warehouse name and address in Odoo match "
"the :ref:`previously defined warehouse <inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"sendcloud-warehouse-config>` in the Sendcloud setup. For details on "
"warehouse configuration in Odoo, refer to the :ref:`warehouse configuration "
"section <inventory/shipping_receiving/configure-source-address>` of the "
"third-party shipping documentation."
msgstr ""
"**Адрес на склада**: уверете се, че името и адресът на склада в Odoo "
"съвпадат с :ref:`предварително дефинирания склад <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/sendcloud-warehouse-config>` в настройката на Sendcloud. "
"За подробности относно конфигурацията на склад в Odoo вижте "
"раздела :ref:`конфигурация на склада <inventory/shipping_receiving/configure-"
"source-address>` от документацията за външни доставчици на превоз."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:279
msgid "Generate labels with Sendcloud"
msgstr "Генериране на етикети със Sendcloud"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:281
msgid ""
"When creating a quotation in Odoo, add shipping and a :guilabel:`Sendcloud "
"shipping product`. Then, :guilabel:`Validate` the delivery. Shipping label "
"documents are automatically generated in the chatter, which include the "
"following:"
msgstr ""
"При създаване на оферта в Odoo добавете доставка и :guilabel:`Sendcloud "
"shipping product`. След това валидирайте доставката "
"чрез :guilabel:`Validate`. Документите за етикети за доставка се генерират "
"автоматично в чатъра, като включват следното:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:286
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Return label(s)` if the Sendcloud connector is configured for "
"returns."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Return label(s)`, ако конекторът на Sendcloud е конфигуриран за "
"връщания."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:287
msgid ":guilabel:`Shipping labels` depending on the number of packages."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Етикети за доставка` в зависимост от броя на пакетите."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:288
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Return labels` if the Sendcloud connector is configured for "
"returns."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Етикети за връщане`, ако конекторът за Sendcloud е конфигуриран "
"за връщания."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:289
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Customs documents` should the destination country require them."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Митнически документи`, ако страната на местоназначение ги изисква."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:294
msgid ""
"When return labels are created, Sendcloud automatically charges the "
"configured Sendcloud account."
msgstr ""
"Когато се създават етикети за връщане, Sendcloud автоматично начислява "
"сумата на конфигурирания акаунт в Sendcloud."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:297
msgid "Shipping rules"
msgstr "Правила за доставка"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:299
msgid ""
"Optionally, create shipping rules to automatically generate shipping labels "
"tailored to different product needs. For example, a shipping rule can be "
"created for customers shipping expensive jewelry product needs. For example, "
"a shipping rule can be created to automatically purchase insurance for "
"customers shipping expensive jewelry."
msgstr ""
"По желание създайте правила за доставка за автоматично генериране на етикети "
"за доставка, съобразени с различните нужди на продуктите. Например правило "
"за доставка може да бъде създадено за нуждите на продукти на клиенти, "
"изпращащи скъпи бижута. Например може да бъде създадено правило за доставка "
"за автоматично закупуване на застраховка за клиенти, които изпращат скъпи "
"бижута."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:305
msgid ""
"Shipping rules do **not** affect :ref:`shipping rate calculations <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/third-party-rate>`, and are only used to improve the "
"process of :doc:`generating shipping labels <labels>`."
msgstr ""
"Правилата за доставка **не** влияят на :ref:`изчисленията на тарифите за "
"доставка <inventory/shipping_receiving/third-party-rate>` и се използват "
"само за подобряване на процеса на :doc:`генериране на етикети за доставка "
"<labels>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:309
msgid ""
"To use shipping rules, navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Configuration --> Delivery: Shipping Methods`, and select the intended "
"`Sendcloud` shipping method."
msgstr ""
"За да използвате правила за доставка, отидете на :menuselection:`Складова "
"наличност --> Конфигуриране --> Доставка: Методи на доставка` и изберете "
"желания метод на доставка `Sendcloud`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:312
msgid ""
"Under the :guilabel:`Sendcloud Configuration` tab, in "
"the :guilabel:`OPTIONS` section, choose the kind of shipments the shipping "
"rules apply to, via the :guilabel:`Use Sendcloud shipping rules` Under the "
"*Sendcloud Configuration* tab, in the *Options* section, choose the kind of "
"shipments the shipping rules apply to, via the :guilabel:`Use Sendcloud "
"shipping rules` field."
msgstr ""
"В раздела :guilabel:`Конфигурация на Sendcloud`, в секция :guilabel:`ОПЦИИ`, "
"изберете вида пратки, за които се прилагат правилата за доставка, "
"чрез :guilabel:`Използване на правила за доставка на Sendcloud` В раздела "
"*Sendcloud Configuration*, в секцията *Options*, изберете вида пратки, за "
"които се прилагат правилата за доставка, чрез полето :guilabel:`Използване "
"на правила за доставка на Sendcloud`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:317
msgid ""
"From here, choose either: :guilabel:`Shipping` to "
"customers, :guilabel:`Returns` from customers, or :guilabel:`Both`."
msgstr ""
"Оттук изберете едно от следните: :guilabel:`Доставка` към "
"клиенти, :guilabel:`Връщания` от клиенти, или :guilabel:`И двете`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:320
msgid "Use Shipping Rules field."
msgstr "Полето за използване на правила за доставка."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:323
msgid ""
"Then, in the Sendcloud website, navigate to :menuselection:`Settings --> "
"Shipping rules`. Create a new shipping rule by clicking :guilabel:`Create "
"New`."
msgstr ""
"След това, в уебсайта на Sendcloud, отидете на :menuselection:`Настройки --> "
"Правила за доставка`. Създайте ново правило за доставка, като кликнете "
"върху :guilabel:`Създаване на ново`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:326
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Actions` section, set a :guilabel:`Condition` to determine "
"when the rule applies. Then, configure what to do when packages meet the "
"condition."
msgstr ""
"В секцията :guilabel:`Действия` задайте :guilabel:`Условие`, за да "
"определите кога се прилага правилото. След това конфигурирайте какво да се "
"случва, когато пакетите отговарят на условието."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:330
msgid ""
"`Create shipping rules on Sendcloud <https://support.sendcloud.com/hc/en-us/"
"articles/ 10274470454292-How-to-create-shipping-rules#examples-smart-"
"shipping-rules>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Създаване на правила за доставка в Sendcloud <https://support.sendcloud.com/"
"hc/en-us/articles/ 10274470454292-How-to-create-shipping-rules#examples-"
"smart-shipping-rules>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:337
msgid "Shipment is too heavy"
msgstr "Пратката е твърде тежка"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:339
msgid ""
"If the shipment is too heavy for the Sendcloud service that is configured, "
"then the weight is split to simulate multiple packages. Products will need "
"to be put in different :guilabel:`Packages` to :guilabel:`Validate` the "
"transfer and generate labels."
msgstr ""
"Ако пратката е твърде тежка за конфигурираната услуга на Sendcloud, теглото "
"се разделя, за да се симулират няколко пакета. Продуктите трябва да бъдат "
"поставени в различни :guilabel:`Пакети`, за да можете "
"да :guilabel:`Валидирате` трансфера и да генерирате етикети."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:343
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Rules` can also be set up in Sendcloud to use other shipping "
"methods when the weight is too heavy. However, note that these rules will "
"not apply to the shipping price calculation on the calculation on the sales "
"order."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Правила` могат също да бъдат настроени в Sendcloud за използване "
"на други методи на доставка, когато теглото е твърде голямо. Имайте предвид "
"обаче, че тези правила няма да се прилагат за изчисляването на цената за "
"доставка в поръчката за продажба."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:348
msgid "Personal carrier contract"
msgstr "Личен договор с превозвач"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:350
msgid ""
"Use custom prices from a direct carrier contract, via CSV upload, by first "
"logging into Sendcloud, navigating to :menuselection:`Settings --> Carriers "
"--> My contracts`, and then selecting the intended contract."
msgstr ""
"Използвайте персонализирани цени от директен договор с превозвач чрез "
"качване на CSV файл, като първо влезете в Sendcloud, отидете "
"на :menuselection:`Настройки --> Превозвачи --> Моите договори` и след това "
"изберете желания договор."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:354
msgid "Navigate to the contracts section in Sendcloud."
msgstr "Отидете в секцията за договори в Sendcloud."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:357
msgid ""
"Under the :guilabel:`Contract prices` section, click :guilabel:`Download "
"CSV` and fill out the contract prices in the :guilabel:`price` column of the "
"CSV file template."
msgstr ""
"В секцията :guilabel:`Цени по договор` кликнете върху :guilabel:`Изтегляне "
"на CSV` и попълнете цените по договора в колоната :guilabel:`цена` на "
"шаблона на CSV файла."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:361
msgid ""
"Ensure the CSV file includes the correct prices to avoid any inaccuracies."
msgstr ""
"Уверете се, че CSV файлът съдържа правилните цени, за да избегнете "
"неточности."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:363
msgid "Show sample contract CSV from Sendcloud, highlighting the price column."
msgstr ""
"Показва примерен CSV файл с договор от Sendcloud, като е откроена колоната с "
"цени."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:366
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Upload` the completed CSV file to Sendcloud, then "
"click :guilabel:`Save these prices`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Качете` попълнения CSV файл в Sendcloud, след което кликнете "
"върху :guilabel:`Запазете тези цени`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:369
msgid ""
"`Sendcloud: How to upload contract prices with carriers <https://"
"support.sendcloud.com/hc/en-us/articles/5163547066004>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Sendcloud: Как да качите цени по договор с превозвачи <https://"
"support.sendcloud.com/hc/en-us/articles/5163547066004>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:375
msgid ""
"Many carriers have several measures for weight. There is the actual weight "
"of the products in the parcel, and there is the *volumetric weight*. "
"Volumetric weight is the volume that a package occupies when in transit. In "
"other words, it is the physical size of a package."
msgstr ""
"Много превозвачи използват няколко мерки за тегло. Съществува действителното "
"тегло на продуктите в пратката, както и *обемното тегло*. Обемното тегло е "
"обемът, който даден пакет заема при транспортиране. С други думи, това е "
"физическият размер на пакета."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:380
msgid ""
"Check to see if selected carriers already have defined formulas to compute "
"the volumetric weight."
msgstr ""
"Проверете дали избраните превозвачи вече имат дефинирани формули за "
"изчисляване на обемното тегло."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:383
msgid ""
"`Sendcloud: How to calculate & automate parcel volumetric weight <https://"
"support.sendcloud.com/ hc/en-us/articles/360059644051-How-to-calculate-"
"automate-parcel-volumetric-weight>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Sendcloud: Как да изчислите и автоматизирате обемното тегло на пратката "
"<https://support.sendcloud.com/ hc/en-us/articles/360059644051-How-to-"
"calculate-automate-parcel-volumetric-weight>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:387
msgid "Unable to calculate shipping rate"
msgstr "Невъзможност за изчисляване на тарифата за доставка"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:389
msgid ""
"First, verify that the product being shipped has a weight that is supported "
"by the selected shipping method. If this is set, then verify that the "
"destination country (from the customer address) is supported by the carrier. "
"The country of origin (warehouse address) should also be supported by the "
"carrier."
msgstr ""
"Първо проверете дали изпращаният продукт има тегло, което се поддържа от "
"избрания метод на доставка. Ако това е зададено, проверете дали страната на "
"местоназначение (от адреса на клиента) се поддържа от превозвача. Страната "
"на произход (адресът на склада) също трябва да се поддържа от превозвача."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:395
msgid ""
"`Magic Sheet - Connect Sendcloud [PDF] <https://drive.google.com/drive/"
"folders/1Cj_bbIn2gOA6HNDFEI8AhjUvcxe2wSMf>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Magic Sheet - Connect Sendcloud [PDF] <https://drive.google.com/drive/"
"folders/1Cj_bbIn2gOA6HNDFEI8AhjUvcxe2wSMf>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:3
msgid "Shiprocket integration"
msgstr "Интеграция с Shiprocket"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:5
msgid ""
"Shiprocket is an Indian service that allows users to connect with multiple "
"carriers, like Delhivery, Blue Dart, DTDC, India Post, Xpressbees, and more. "
"To manage Shiprocket shipments to clients directly within Odoo, it must "
"first be configured."
msgstr ""
"Shiprocket е индийска услуга, която позволява на потребителите да се "
"свързват с множество превозвачи, като Delhivery, Blue Dart, DTDC, India "
"Post, Xpressbees и други. За да управлявате пратки чрез Shiprocket до "
"клиенти директно от Odoo, услугата трябва първо да бъде конфигурирана."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:11
msgid ""
":ref:`Create a Shiprocket account <inventory/shiprocket/account-setup>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Създаване на акаунт в Shiprocket <inventory/shiprocket/account-setup>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:12
msgid ":ref:`Create an API user <inventory/shiprocket/api-user>`."
msgstr ":ref:`Създаване на API потребител <inventory/shiprocket/api-user>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:13
msgid ":ref:`Create a sales channel <inventory/shiprocket/sales-channel>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Създаване на канал за продажби <inventory/shiprocket/sales-channel>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:14
msgid ":ref:`Enable couriers <inventory/shiprocket/enable-couriers>`."
msgstr ":ref:`Активиране на куриери <inventory/shiprocket/enable-couriers>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:15
msgid ""
":ref:`Enable the Shiprocket connector in Odoo <inventory/shiprocket/enable>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Активиране на конектора Shiprocket в Odoo <inventory/shiprocket/"
"enable>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:16
msgid ""
":ref:`Configure the delivery method in Odoo <inventory/shiprocket/"
"configure>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Конфигуриране на метода на доставка в Odoo <inventory/shiprocket/"
"configure>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:18
msgid ""
"Upon completion, it is possible to calculate shipping costs based on package "
"size and weight, have the charges applied directly to a Shiprocket account, "
"and automatically print Shiprocket tracking labels in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"След завършването е възможно да се изчисляват разходите за доставка въз "
"основа на размера и теглото на пакета, начисленията да се прилагат директно "
"към акаунт в Shiprocket и автоматично да се отпечатват в Odoo етикети за "
"проследяване на Shiprocket."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:27
msgid ""
"To begin, go to the `Shiprocket website <https://app.shiprocket.in/"
"newlogin>`_ to create or log into the company's Shiprocket account."
msgstr ""
"За да започнете, отидете на `уебсайта на Shiprocket <https://"
"app.shiprocket.in/newlogin>`_, за да създадете или влезете в акаунта на "
"компанията в Shiprocket."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:30
msgid "Follow the website's steps to complete registration."
msgstr "Следвайте стъпките на уебсайта, за да завършите регистрацията."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:35
msgid "Create API user"
msgstr "Създаване на API потребител"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:37
msgid ""
"On the Shiprocket *Homepage*, open the :menuselection:`Settings` menu. In "
"the *Additional Settings* section, navigate to the :menuselection:`API "
"Users` page."
msgstr ""
"На *началната страница* на Shiprocket отворете "
"менюто :menuselection:`Настройки`. В секцията *Допълнителни настройки* "
"отидете на страницата :menuselection:`API потребители`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:40
msgid ""
"On the *API Users* page, click the :guilabel:`+ Add New API User` button. In "
"the *Add New User* window, specify an :guilabel:`Email ID`. Open "
"the :guilabel:`Select Modules to Access` menu and select :guilabel:`Orders "
"(create, "
"update)`, :guilabel:`Settings`, :guilabel:`Shipments`, :guilabel:`Listings`, "
"and :guilabel:`Courier`, then click :guilabel:`Apply`. Finally, "
"click :guilabel:`Create User` to add the user."
msgstr ""
"На страницата *API потребители* кликнете върху бутона :guilabel:`+ Добавяне "
"на нов API потребител`. В прозореца *Добавяне на нов потребител* "
"въведете :guilabel:`Имейл ID`. Отворете менюто :guilabel:`Избор на модули за "
"достъп` и изберете :guilabel:`Поръчки (създаване, "
"актуализиране)`, :guilabel:`Настройки`, :guilabel:`Пратки`, :guilabel:`Обяви` "
"и :guilabel:`Куриер`, след което кликнете върху :guilabel:`Приложи`. Накрая "
"кликнете върху :guilabel:`Създаване на потребител`, за да добавите "
"потребителя."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:46
msgid "Copy the API password from the *Your API Password* window."
msgstr "Копирайте API паролата от прозореца *Вашата API парола*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:48
msgid ""
"Click the Copy token icon to copy the password to the device's clipboard."
msgstr ""
"Кликнете върху иконата за копиране на токена, за да копирате паролата в "
"клипборда на устройството."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:54
msgid "Create sales channel"
msgstr "Създаване на канал за продажби"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:56
msgid ""
"From the sidebar, navigate to :menuselection:`Setup & Manage --> Channels`. "
"On the *Sales Channels* page, click :guilabel:`Connect New Channel`. In the "
"*Shopping Carts* section, click the :guilabel:`Add` button under the "
"*Manual* heading. The *Manual* settings page opens."
msgstr ""
"От страничната лента отидете на :menuselection:`Настройка и управление --> "
"Канали`. На страницата *Канали за продажби* кликнете "
"върху :guilabel:`Свързване на нов канал`. В секцията *Пазарски колички* "
"кликнете върху бутона :guilabel:`Добавяне` под заглавието *Ръчно*. Отваря се "
"страницата с настройки *Ръчно*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:60
msgid ""
"Specify a :guilabel:`Channel Name`, such as `Odoo`. Click :guilabel:`Save "
"Channel & Test Connection`."
msgstr ""
"Въведете :guilabel:`Име на канал`, например `Odoo`. Кликнете "
"върху :guilabel:`Запазване на канал и тестване на връзката`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:63
msgid "Create a sales channel."
msgstr "Създаване на канал за продажби."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:69
msgid "Configure couriers"
msgstr "Конфигуриране на куриери"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:71
msgid ""
"From the sidebar, navigate to :menuselection:`Setup & Manage --> Courier`. "
"On the *Courier Selection* page, enable or disable shipping couriers."
msgstr ""
"От страничната лента отидете на :menuselection:`Настройка и управление --> "
"Куриер`. На страницата *Избор на куриер* активирайте или деактивирайте "
"куриерите за доставка."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:74
msgid "Toggle couriers to select them on the Courier Selection page."
msgstr ""
"Превключете куриерите, за да ги изберете на страницата за избор на куриер."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:77
msgid ""
"Open the :menuselection:`Courier Priority` page. Set a priority ranking to "
"which orders are assigned and click :guilabel:`Save`. The courier is "
"selected in Odoo based on this priority. For example, "
"if :guilabel:`Cheapest` is selected, the most cost-effective courier is "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"Отворете страницата :menuselection:`Приоритет на куриер`. Задайте ранг на "
"приоритет, по който се разпределят поръчките, и кликнете "
"върху :guilabel:`Запазване`. Куриерът се избира в Odoo въз основа на този "
"приоритет. Например, ако е избрано :guilabel:`Най-евтин`, се избира най-"
"икономичният куриер."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:84
msgid "Enable connector"
msgstr "Активиране на конектор"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:86
msgid ""
"The *Shiprocket Connector* must be enabled before a shipping method can be "
"configured."
msgstr ""
"*Конекторът Shiprocket* трябва да бъде активиран, преди да може да се "
"конфигурира метод на доставка."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:88
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Settings`. "
"In the *Shipping Connectors* section, enable :guilabel:`Shiprocket "
"Connector`, then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Отидете на :menuselection:`Складова наличност --> Конфигуриране --> "
"Настройки`. В секцията *Конектори за доставка* "
"активирайте :guilabel:`Конектор Shiprocket`, след което кликнете "
"върху :guilabel:`Запазване`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:94
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/usps.rst:48
msgid "Configure delivery method"
msgstr "Конфигуриране на метод за доставка"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:96
msgid ""
"Configure the Shiprocket delivery method in Odoo by going "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Delivery Methods`."
msgstr ""
"Конфигурирайте метода на доставка Shiprocket в Odoo, като отидете "
"на :menuselection:`Складова наличност --> Конфигуриране --> Методи на "
"доставка`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:99
msgid ""
"On the *Delivery Methods* page, open the :guilabel:`ShipRocket Domestic` "
"shipping method, or click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"На страницата *Методи на доставка* отворете метода на "
"доставка :guilabel:`ShipRocket Domestic`, или кликнете "
"върху :guilabel:`Ново`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:102
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Provider` field, select :guilabel:`Shiprocket` from the "
"list of providers. Doing so reveals the *Shiprocket Configuration* tab at "
"the bottom of the form, where Shiprocket credentials are entered."
msgstr ""
"В полето :guilabel:`Доставчик` изберете :guilabel:`Shiprocket` от списъка с "
"доставчици. Това ще покаже раздела *Конфигурация на Shiprocket* в долната "
"част на формуляра, където се въвеждат идентификационните данни за Shiprocket."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:106
msgid ""
"For details on configuring the other fields on the shipping method, such "
"as :guilabel:`Delivery Product`, refer to the :doc:`new_delivery_method` "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"За подробности относно конфигурирането на другите полета на метода за "
"доставка, като :guilabel:`Продукт за доставка`, вижте "
"документацията :doc:`new_delivery_method`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:110
msgid ""
"To generate Shiprocket shipping labels through Odoo, ensure "
"the :guilabel:`Integration Level` option is set to :guilabel:`Get Rate and "
"Create Shipment`."
msgstr ""
"За да генерирате етикети за доставка на Shiprocket чрез Odoo, уверете се, че "
"опцията :guilabel:`Ниво на интеграция` е зададена на :guilabel:`Получаване "
"на тарифа и създаване на пратка`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:114
msgid "Shiprocket Configuration tab"
msgstr "Раздел Конфигурация на Shiprocket"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:116
msgid ""
"Enter the API user email address in the :guilabel:`Shiprocket Email` field. "
"Enter the API password for the user in the :guilabel:`Shiprocket Password` "
"field. Click the :guilabel:`Test Connection` link."
msgstr ""
"Въведете имейл адреса на API потребителя в полето :guilabel:`Имейл за "
"Shiprocket`. Въведете API паролата на потребителя в полето :guilabel:`Парола "
"за Shiprocket`. Кликнете върху връзката :guilabel:`Тестване на връзката`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:120
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`Pickup Request` to send a pickup request when a delivery "
"order is validated."
msgstr ""
"Изберете :guilabel:`Заявка за вземане`, за да изпратите заявка за вземане на "
"пратката, когато поръчката за доставка бъде потвърдена."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:122
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`Generate Manifest` to generate a shipping manifest and "
"streamline the pickup process."
msgstr ""
"Изберете :guilabel:`Генериране на манифест`, за да генерирате манифест за "
"доставка и да улесните процеса на вземане."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:125
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Package Type` field, select a package dimension to use for "
"shipments."
msgstr ""
"В полето :guilabel:`Тип пакет` изберете размер на пакета, който да се "
"използва за пратките."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:127
msgid ""
"To retrieve the list of supported Shiprocket couriers, click the :icon:`fa-"
"refresh` :guilabel:`(Sync Couriers from Shiprocket)` icon next to "
"the :guilabel:`Shiprocket Couriers` field. Select the couriers to use in "
"the :guilabel:`Shiprocket Couriers` field. If this field is left blank, Odoo "
"will select the first courier based on the :ref:`courier priority <inventory/"
"shiprocket/enable-couriers>` set in the Shiprocket portal."
msgstr ""
"За да извлечете списъка с поддържани куриери на Shiprocket, кликнете върху "
"иконата :icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`(Синхронизиране на куриери от "
"Shiprocket)` до полето :guilabel:`Куриери на Shiprocket`. Изберете "
"куриерите, които да се използват, в полето :guilabel:`Куриери на "
"Shiprocket`. Ако това поле е оставено празно, Odoo ще избере първия куриер "
"въз основа на :ref:`приоритета на куриерите <inventory/shiprocket/enable-"
"couriers>`, зададен в портала на Shiprocket."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:133
msgid ""
"To retrieve the list of Shiprocket channels, click the :icon:`fa-"
"refresh` :guilabel:`(Sync Channel from Shiprocket)` icon next to "
"the :guilabel:`Shiprocket Channel` field. In the :guilabel:`Shiprocket "
"Channel` field, select the sales channel that was created in "
"the :ref:`inventory/shiprocket/sales-channel` step."
msgstr ""
"За да извлечете списъка с канали на Shiprocket, кликнете върху "
"иконата :icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`(Синхронизиране на канал от "
"Shiprocket)` до полето :guilabel:`Канал на Shiprocket`. В "
"полето :guilabel:`Канал на Shiprocket` изберете канала за продажби, който "
"беше създаден в стъпката :ref:`inventory/shiprocket/sales-channel`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:138
msgid "Complete the fields of the form to make the shipping method available."
msgstr ""
"Попълнете полетата на формуляра, за да направите метода на доставка достъпен."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:142
msgid "Availability tab"
msgstr "Раздел Наличност"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:144
msgid ""
"Use the *Availability* tab to specify the :guilabel:`Countries` to which the "
"shipping method should apply. Shiprocket supports deliveries to over 220 "
"countries."
msgstr ""
"Използвайте раздела *Наличност*, за да посочите :guilabel:`Държави`, за "
"които трябва да се прилага методът на доставка. Shiprocket поддържа доставки "
"до над 220 държави."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:150
msgid ""
"To use Shiprocket to generate shipping labels, the following information "
"**must** be filled out accurately and completely in Odoo:"
msgstr ""
"За да използвате Shiprocket за генериране на етикети за доставка, следната "
"информация **трябва** да бъде попълнена точно и изцяло в Odoo:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:156
msgid ""
"To verify, select the :guilabel:`Customer` field to open their contact page. "
"Add their shipping address in the :guilabel:`Contact` field, along with "
"their :guilabel:`Mobile` number and :guilabel:`Email` address."
msgstr ""
"За да проверите, изберете полето :guilabel:`Клиент`, за да отворите "
"страницата им за контакт. Добавете адреса им за доставка в "
"полето :guilabel:`Контакт`, заедно с номера им за :guilabel:`Мобилен "
"телефон` и адреса за :guilabel:`Имейл`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:159
msgid ""
"**Product weight**: Ensure all products in a delivery order have a "
"specified :guilabel:`Weight` in the *Inventory* tab of their product form. "
"Refer to the :ref:`inventory/shipping_receiving/configure-weight` "
"documentation for detailed instructions."
msgstr ""
"**Тегло на продукта**: Уверете се, че всички продукти в поръчка за доставка "
"имат посочено :guilabel:`Тегло` в раздела *Складова наличност* на формуляра "
"на продукта. Вижте документацията :ref:`inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"configure-weight` за подробни инструкции."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:162
msgid ""
"**Warehouse address**: By default all packages are sent from the specified "
"address in the warehouse. Make sure to set the :guilabel:`Address` in the "
"warehouse form with a valid phone number and email address."
msgstr ""
"**Адрес на склада**: По подразбиране всички пакети се изпращат от посочения "
"адрес в склада. Уверете се, че сте задали :guilabel:`Адрес` във формуляра на "
"склада с валиден телефонен номер и имейл адрес."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:167
msgid "Generate a Shiprocket label"
msgstr "Генериране на етикет на Shiprocket"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:169
msgid ""
"When creating a quotation in Odoo, add the Shiprocket shipping method by "
"clicking the :guilabel:`Add shipping` button."
msgstr ""
"При създаване на оферта в Odoo добавете метода на доставка Shiprocket, като "
"кликнете върху бутона :guilabel:`Добавяне на доставка`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:172
msgid ""
"In the *Add a shipping method* pop-up window, select :guilabel:`Shiprocket` "
"in the :guilabel:`Shipping Method` field. Calculate the shipping rate by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Get rate`. Finally, click :guilabel:`Add` to include the "
"shipping cost on the sales order line, labeled as the *delivery product*."
msgstr ""
"В изскачащия прозорец *Добавяне на метод на доставка* "
"изберете :guilabel:`Shiprocket` в полето :guilabel:`Метод на доставка`. "
"Изчислете тарифата за доставка, като кликнете върху :guilabel:`Получаване на "
"тарифа`. Накрая кликнете върху :guilabel:`Добавяне`, за да включите разхода "
"за доставка в реда на поръчката за продажба, обозначен като *продукт за "
"доставка*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:177
msgid "Add Shiprocket shipping to a sales order."
msgstr "Добавяне на доставка чрез Shiprocket към поръчка за продажба."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:181
msgid ""
"Automatically calculate shipping costs for Shiprocket in both the **Sales** "
"and **eCommerce** applications."
msgstr ""
"Автоматично изчисляване на разходите за доставка за Shiprocket както в "
"приложението **Продажби**, така и в приложението **Електронна търговия**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:184
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:212
msgid ""
"Then, :guilabel:`Validate` the delivery. Shipping label documents are "
"automatically generated in the chatter, which includes the following:"
msgstr ""
"След това :guilabel:`Валидирайте` доставката. Документите с етикети за "
"доставка се генерират автоматично в chatter, който включва следното:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:187
msgid "**Shipping labels**, depending on the number of packages."
msgstr "**Етикети за доставка**, в зависимост от броя на пакетите."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:188
msgid "**Tracking numbers**, if the selected courier supports it."
msgstr "**Номера за проследяване**, ако избраният куриер го поддържа."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:190
msgid "After the delivery is validated, a label is generated."
msgstr "След като доставката бъде валидирана, се генерира етикет."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:194
msgid ""
"If the shipment is too heavy for the configured Shiprocket service, the "
"weight is split to simulate multiple packages. Products must be put in "
"different packages to validate the transfer and generate labels."
msgstr ""
"Ако пратката е твърде тежка за конфигурираната услуга Shiprocket, теглото се "
"разделя, за да се симулират няколко пакета. Продуктите трябва да бъдат "
"поставени в различни пакети, за да се валидира трансферът и да се генерират "
"етикети."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:199
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:250
msgid "Cancellations"
msgstr "Анулирания"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:201
msgid ""
"If a delivery order is canceled in Odoo, it is automatically archived in "
"Shiprocket. However, the cancellation will not be sent to the courier "
"directly, so make sure to log in to the courier's platform to handle it "
"manually."
msgstr ""
"Ако поръчка за доставка бъде анулирана в Odoo, тя автоматично се архивира в "
"Shiprocket. Анулирането обаче няма да бъде изпратено директно до куриера, "
"затова се уверете, че сте влезли в платформата на куриера, за да го "
"обработите ръчно."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:206
msgid "Turn on Shiprocket integration"
msgstr "Активиране на интеграцията с Shiprocket"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:208
msgid ""
"After the Shiprocket connection is set up, use the smart buttons at the top "
"of the form to publish, turn on production mode, or activate debug logging."
msgstr ""
"След като връзката с Shiprocket е настроена, използвайте интелигентните "
"бутони в горната част на формуляра, за да публикувате, да включите "
"производствен режим или да активирате логване за отстраняване на грешки."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:211
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Unpublished/Published`: Click this smart button to make this "
"shipping method available on the **eCommerce** website."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Непубликувано/Публикувано`: Кликнете върху този интелигентен "
"бутон, за да направите този метод на доставка достъпен на уебсайта за "
"**Електронна търговия**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:213
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Test Environment/Production Environment`: Click this smart button "
"to specify whether labels are for testing only and are canceled immediately "
"(Test), or whether real shipping labels can be generated and charged to the "
"Shiprocket account (Production). In the Test environment, the amount of the "
"canceled shipment is refunded in 3 to 4 days."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Тестова среда/Производствена среда`: Кликнете върху този "
"интелигентен бутон, за да посочите дали етикетите са само за тестване и се "
"анулират незабавно (Тест), или дали могат да се генерират реални етикети за "
"доставка, начислявани към акаунта в Shiprocket (Производство). В тестовата "
"среда сумата на анулираната пратка се възстановява в рамките на 3 до 4 дни."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:217
msgid ""
":guilabel:`No Debug/Debug Requests`: Click this smart button to specify "
"whether API requests and responses are logged in Odoo (:doc:`turn on "
"developer mode <../../../../general/developer_mode>` and go "
"to :menuselection:`Settings app --> Technical --> Logging`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Без дебъг/Дебъг заявки`: Кликнете върху този интелигентен бутон, "
"за да посочите дали заявките и отговорите на API се логват в Odoo "
"(:doc:`активирайте режим на разработчик <../../../../general/"
"developer_mode>` и отидете на :menuselection:`Настройки --> Технически --> "
"Логове`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:3
msgid "ShipStation integration"
msgstr "Интеграция с ShipStation"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:5
msgid ""
"ShipStation is an all-in-one shipping and fulfillment platform. Integrating "
"ShipStation with Odoo makes it possible to calculate shipping costs and "
"print shipping labels directly through Odoo."
msgstr ""
"ShipStation е цялостна платформа за доставка и изпълнение на поръчки. "
"Интегрирането на ShipStation с Odoo позволява изчисляване на разходите за "
"доставка и отпечатване на етикети за доставка директно през Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:8
msgid ""
"ShipStation supports integration with carriers including UPS, USPS, FedEx, "
"and DHL. International carriers such as Mercado Libre and OnTrac are also "
"supported."
msgstr ""
"ShipStation поддържа интеграция с превозвачи, включително UPS, USPS, FedEx и "
"DHL. Поддържат се и международни превозвачи като Mercado Libre и OnTrac."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:17
msgid ""
"To enable ShipStation as a delivery method in Odoo, :ref:`retrieve the API "
"key and set carrier preferences in ShipStation <inventory/shipstation/api-"
"key-carriers>`, then :ref:`create ShipStation delivery methods in Odoo "
"<inventory/shipstation/create-delivery-method>`."
msgstr ""
"За да активирате ShipStation като метод за доставка в Odoo, :ref:`извлечете "
"API ключа и задайте предпочитанията за превозвач в ShipStation <inventory/"
"shipstation/api-key-carriers>`, след което :ref:`създайте методи за доставка "
"на ShipStation в Odoo <inventory/shipstation/create-delivery-method>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:24
msgid "Configuration in ShipStation"
msgstr "Конфигурация в ShipStation"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:26
msgid ""
"To configure carrier preferences in ShipStation, go to the `ShipStation "
"website <https://www.shipstation.com/start-a-free-trial/>`_ and sign in or "
"create a ShipStation account."
msgstr ""
"За да конфигурирате предпочитанията за превозвач в ShipStation, отидете на "
"`уебсайта на ShipStation <https://www.shipstation.com/start-a-free-trial/>`_ "
"и влезте в профила си или създайте акаунт в ShipStation."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Obtain test and production API keys**: Go to :menuselection:`Settings --> "
"Account --> API Settings`, select :guilabel:`V2 API`, and "
"click :guilabel:`Generate API Key`."
msgstr ""
"**Получаване на тестови и производствени API ключове**: Отидете "
"в :menuselection:`Настройки --> Акаунт --> Настройки на API`, "
"изберете :guilabel:`V2 API` и щракнете върху :guilabel:`Генериране на API "
"ключ`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:32
msgid "ShipStation API Settings page with Generate API Key button."
msgstr ""
"Страница с настройки за API на ShipStation с бутон „Генериране на API ключ“."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:36
msgid ""
"For the integration to work in Odoo, the :guilabel:`V2 API` needs to be "
"selected from the version drop-down, as it is the only one supported."
msgstr ""
"За да работи интеграцията в Odoo, :guilabel:`V2 API` трябва да бъде избран "
"от падащото меню за версия, тъй като е единственият поддържан."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:39
msgid ""
"**Copy the production key**: Keep the :guilabel:`Production Key` on hand "
"for :ref:`delivery method configuration in Odoo <inventory/shipstation/"
"create-delivery-method>`."
msgstr ""
"**Копиране на производствения ключ**: Дръжте "
"подръка :guilabel:`Производствен ключ` за :ref:`конфигуриране на метода за "
"доставка в Odoo <inventory/shipstation/create-delivery-method>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:42
msgid "ShipStation Production Key \"copy to clipboard\" button."
msgstr "Бутон „Копиране в клипборда“ за производствен ключ в ShipStation."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:45
msgid ""
"**Enable the carrier**: Go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Account --> "
"Shipping --> Carriers`. In the *ShipStation Carriers* tab, enable the "
"desired carriers."
msgstr ""
"**Активиране на превозвача**: Отидете в :menuselection:`Настройки --> Акаунт "
"--> Доставка --> Превозвачи`. В раздела *ShipStation Carriers* активирайте "
"желаните превозвачи."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:48
msgid "ShipStation Carriers list with On/Off toggles."
msgstr ""
"Списък с превозвачи в ShipStation с превключватели за включване/изключване."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:54
msgid "Configuration in Odoo"
msgstr "Конфигурация в Odoo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:56
msgid ""
"To enable ShipStation delivery methods in Odoo, :ref:`install <general/"
"install>` the *ShipStation Shipping* module."
msgstr ""
"За да активирате методите за доставка на ShipStation в "
"Odoo, :ref:`инсталирайте <general/install>` модула *ShipStation Shipping*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:59
msgid ""
"Create one delivery method for each carrier and service enabled in "
"ShipStation. Delivery methods created in Odoo can be selected in the sales "
"order form."
msgstr ""
"Създайте по един метод за доставка за всеки превозвач и услуга, активирани в "
"ShipStation. Създадените в Odoo методи за доставка могат да бъдат избирани "
"във формата на поръчката за продажба."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:62
msgid ""
"To create a delivery method, go to :menuselection:`Inventory --> "
"Configuration --> Delivery Methods`, then click :guilabel:`New`. In the "
"*Delivery Method* form, fill in the following fields:"
msgstr ""
"За да създадете метод за доставка, отидете в :menuselection:`Склад --> "
"Конфигурация --> Методи за доставка`, след което щракнете "
"върху :guilabel:`Нов`. Във формата *Метод за доставка* попълнете следните "
"полета:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:65
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Name`: Enter a name for the delivery method, e.g., `ShipStation + "
"UPS Ground`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Име`: Въведете име за метода на доставка, напр. `ShipStation + "
"UPS Ground`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:66
msgid ":guilabel:`Provider`: Select :guilabel:`ShipStation` as the provider."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Доставчик`: Изберете :guilabel:`ShipStation` като доставчик."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:67
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Integration Level`: Select :guilabel:`Get Rate and Create "
"Shipment` to generate shipping labels through Odoo."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Ниво на интеграция`: Изберете :guilabel:`Получаване на тарифа и "
"създаване на пратка`, за да генерирате етикети за доставка чрез Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:69
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delivery Product`: Select a generic delivery product "
"(:guilabel:`Delivery Charges`), or create a dedicated ShipStation delivery "
"product specifically to track delivery orders that use this method."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Продукт за доставка`: Изберете общ продукт за доставка "
"(:guilabel:`Разходи за доставка`) или създайте специален продукт за доставка "
"за ShipStation, специално предназначен за проследяване на поръчки за "
"доставка, които използват този метод."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:73
msgid "Delivery method form in Odoo with the ShipStation provider selected."
msgstr "Формуляр за метод на доставка в Odoo с избран доставчик ShipStation."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:77
msgid ""
"To generate ShipStation shipping labels through Odoo, "
"the :guilabel:`Integration Level` field must be set to :guilabel:`Get Rate "
"and Create Shipment`."
msgstr ""
"За да генерирате етикети за доставка на ShipStation чрез Odoo, "
"полето :guilabel:`Ниво на интеграция` трябва да бъде зададено "
"на :guilabel:`Получаване на тарифа и създаване на пратка`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:80
msgid ""
"When the :guilabel:`Provider` is set to :guilabel:`ShipStation`, the "
"*ShipStation Configuration* tab appears. Fill in the following fields in the "
"*ShipStation Configuration* tab:"
msgstr ""
"Когато :guilabel:`Доставчик` е зададен на :guilabel:`ShipStation`, се "
"показва разделът *ShipStation Configuration*. Попълнете следните полета в "
"раздела *ShipStation Configuration*:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:83
msgid ""
":guilabel:`ShipStation API Key`: Paste the :ref:`ShipStation V2 API "
"Production Key <inventory/shipstation/api-key-carriers>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`API ключ за ShipStation`: Поставете :ref:`ShipStation V2 API "
"Production Key <inventory/shipstation/api-key-carriers>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:85
msgid ":guilabel:`ShipStation Label Layout`: Optionally select a label size."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Оформление на етикета на ShipStation`: По избор изберете размер "
"на етикета."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:86
msgid ""
":guilabel:`ShipStation Label Format`: Optionally select the desired label "
"file format."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Формат на етикета на ShipStation`: По избор изберете желания "
"файлов формат за етикета."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:87
msgid ""
":guilabel:`ShipStation Insurance Provider`: Optionally select an insurance "
"provider."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Застраховател на ShipStation`: По избор изберете застраховател."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:90
msgid ""
"When selecting an insurance provider, make sure to set "
"the :guilabel:`Insurance Percentage` field."
msgstr ""
"Когато избирате застраховател, задължително задайте "
"полето :guilabel:`Процент на застраховката`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:93
msgid ""
":guilabel:`ShipStation Service Name`: Click the :icon:`fa-"
"refresh` :guilabel:`(Sync Carriers/Services from ShipStation)` button to "
"synchronize the available carriers and services from the ShipStation "
"account, then click the field to select the desired carrier and service."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Име на услугата на ShipStation`: Щракнете върху бутона :icon:`fa-"
"refresh` :guilabel:`(Синхронизиране на превозвачи/услуги от ShipStation)`, "
"за да синхронизирате наличните превозвачи и услуги от акаунта в ShipStation, "
"след което щракнете върху полето, за да изберете желания превозвач и услуга."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:96
msgid ""
":guilabel:`ShipStation Default Package`: Select or create a package type for "
"this delivery method. The available package types are defined in the "
"ShipStation account. Make sure the package measurements (length, width, "
"height) match the selected service."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Пакет по подразбиране на ShipStation`: Изберете или създайте тип "
"пакет за този метод на доставка. Наличните типове пакети са дефинирани в "
"акаунта в ShipStation. Уверете се, че размерите на пакета (дължина, ширина, "
"височина) съответстват на избраната услуга."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:101
msgid ""
"When selecting a package type, make sure it is available for the service "
"selected above. This can be verified from the ShipStation website."
msgstr ""
"Когато избирате тип пакет, уверете се, че той е наличен за избраната по-горе "
"услуга. Това може да бъде проверено на уебсайта на ShipStation."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:107
msgid "Generate labels with ShipStation"
msgstr "Генериране на етикети със ShipStation"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:109
msgid ""
"Once a ShipStation delivery method is configured, labels and shipping costs "
"can be generated from within a quotation or sales order form."
msgstr ""
"След като методът на доставка чрез ShipStation бъде конфигуриран, етикетите "
"и разходите за доставка могат да се генерират директно от формуляра за "
"оферта или поръчка за продажба."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:112
msgid ""
":doc:`Create a quotation <../../../../sales/sales/sales_quotations/"
"create_quotations>`, then click :guilabel:`Add Shipping`, and select the "
"delivery method (`ShipStation +` *the selected carrier and service*). The "
"delivery product associated with the method is added to the quotation."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Създайте оферта <../../../../sales/sales/sales_quotations/"
"create_quotations>`, след което щракнете върху :guilabel:`Добавяне на "
"доставка` и изберете метода на доставка (`ShipStation +` *избрания превозвач "
"и услуга*). Продуктът за доставка, свързан с метода, се добавя към офертата."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:116
msgid "Add a delivery method window on a quotation form."
msgstr "Прозорец за добавяне на метод на доставка във формуляр за оферта."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:120
msgid ""
"The product added to the quotation must have a weight associated with it to "
"avoid errors."
msgstr ""
"Продуктът, добавен към офертата, трябва да има зададено тегло, за да се "
"избегнат грешки."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:122
msgid ""
"After confirming the quotation, validate the delivery order to view the "
"shipping information and label."
msgstr ""
"След като потвърдите офертата, валидирайте поръчката за доставка, за да "
"видите информацията за пратката и етикета."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:125
msgid "Validated delivery order with ShipStation shipping information."
msgstr ""
"Валидирана поръчка за доставка с информация за пратката от ShipStation."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:129
msgid ":doc:`labels`"
msgstr ":doc:`labels`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:3
msgid "Starshipit shipping"
msgstr "Доставка чрез Starshipit"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:5
msgid ""
"Starshipit is a shipping service operator that facilitates the integration "
"of Australasian shipping couriers with Odoo. Once integrated, users can "
"create shipping methods that will automatically get rates from specific "
"couriers (such as Australia Post, NZ Post, DHL,...) based on predefined "
"conditions."
msgstr ""
"Starshipit е оператор на услуги за доставка, който улеснява интеграцията на "
"австралазийски куриери за доставка с Odoo. След интегрирането потребителите "
"могат да създават методи на доставка, които автоматично получават тарифи от "
"конкретни куриери (като Australia Post, NZ Post, DHL,...) въз основа на "
"предварително зададени условия."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:11
msgid ":doc:`Automatically calculate shipping <../setup_configuration>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Автоматично изчисляване на доставката <../setup_configuration>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:12
msgid ":doc:`Integrate other third-party couriers <third_party_shipper>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Интегриране на други куриери от трети страни <third_party_shipper>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:15
msgid "Setup in Starshipit"
msgstr "Настройка в Starshipit"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:18
msgid "Create an account and activate couriers"
