msgid ":guilabel:`From`: Source location of the moved product."
msgstr ":guilabel:`От`: изходната локация на преместения продукт."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:152
msgid ":guilabel:`To`: Destination location of the moved product."
msgstr ":guilabel:`До`: крайната локация на преместения продукт."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:153
msgid ":guilabel:`Demand`: Quantity initially planned for the move."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Търсене`: Количество, първоначално планирано за движението."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:154
msgid ":guilabel:`Quantity`: Quantity of products actually moved."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Количество`: Количество на действително преместените продукти."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:155
msgid ":guilabel:`Unit`: Unit of measure of the products moved."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Unit`: мерна единица на преместените продукти."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:156
msgid ":guilabel:`Company`: Company the move belongs to."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Компания`: Компанията, към която принадлежи движението."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:157
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Status`: Indicates the move status, which can "
"be :guilabel:`Done`, :guilabel:`Available` (ready for action), "
"or :guilabel:`Partially Available` (insufficient quantities to complete the "
"operation)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Status`: показва статуса на движението, който може да "
"бъде :guilabel:`Done`, :guilabel:`Available` (готово за действие) "
"или :guilabel:`Partially Available` (недостатъчни количества за завършване "
"на операцията)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:161
msgid ""
"Additional columns "
"for :guilabel:`Contact`, :guilabel:`Owner`, :guilabel:`Value`, :guilabel:`Remaining "
"Quantity`, and :guilabel:`Remaining Value` can be displayed by clicking "
"the :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` :guilabel:`(Settings)` button at the end of "
"the column headers."
msgstr ""
"Допълнителни колони за :guilabel:`Контакт`, :guilabel:`Собственик`, "
":guilabel:`Стойност`, :guilabel:`Оставащо количество` и :guilabel:`Оставаща "
"стойност` могат да бъдат показани чрез кликване върху бутона :icon:`oi-"
"settings-adjust` :guilabel:`(Настройки)` в края на заглавията на колоните."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:165
msgid "The Moves Analysis report in the list view."
msgstr "Отчетът за анализ на движенията в списъчен изглед."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:169
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Quantity` and :guilabel:`Value` of inbound moves are "
"displayed in green, while the :guilabel:`Quantity` and :guilabel:`Value` of "
"outbound moves are displayed in red."
msgstr ""
"В :guilabel:`Количество` и :guilabel:`Стойност` на входящите движения са "
"показани в зелено, докато :guilabel:`Количество` и :guilabel:`Стойност` на "
"изходящите движения са показани в червено."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:175
msgid ":icon:`fa-area-chart` Graph"
msgstr ":icon:`fa-area-chart` Графика"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:177
msgid ""
"The :ref:`graph view <reporting/using-graph>` plots a single measure at a "
"time, making it most suitable for visualizing a trend or comparing values "
"across one dimension at a glance. Select the measure to plot from "
"the :ref:`Measures <inventory/warehouses_storage/moves-analysis-measures>` "
"drop-down in the top-left corner, then choose one of the chart types next to "
"it."
msgstr ""
"В :ref:`графичен изглед <reporting/using-graph>` се изчертава една мярка "
"наведнъж, което го прави най-подходящ за визуализиране на тенденция или "
"сравняване на стойности в едно измерение с един поглед. Изберете мярката за "
"изчертаване от падащото меню :ref:`Измервания <inventory/warehouses_storage/"
"moves-analysis-measures>` в горния ляв ъгъл, след което изберете един от "
"типовете диаграми до него."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:182
msgid "The Moves Analysis report in the graph view."
msgstr "Отчетът за анализ на движенията в графичен изглед."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:188
msgid ":icon:`oi-view-kanban` Kanban"
msgstr ":icon:`oi-view-kanban` Канбан"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:190
msgid ""
"The Kanban view displays one card per move, with the associated "
"product, :guilabel:`Quantity`, and :guilabel:`Demand`. It offers the least "
"analytical depth of the four views, but is useful for browsing recent moves "
"without configuring a list, pivot, or graph."
msgstr ""
"Изгледът Канбан показва по една карта за всяко движение със съответния "
"продукт, :guilabel:`Количество` и :guilabel:`Търсене`. Той предлага най-"
"малка аналитична дълбочина от четирите изгледа, но е полезен за преглеждане "
"на скорошни движения без конфигуриране на списък, обобщена таблица или "
"графика."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:194
msgid "The Moves Analysis report in the Kanban view."
msgstr "Отчетът „Анализ на движенията“ в изглед Канбан."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:200
msgid "Aging report"
msgstr "Отчет за остаряване"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:202
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Aging Report` is a :ref:`Favorites <inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/moves-analysis-search-options>` filter that pre-"
"configures the :guilabel:`Moves Analysis` pivot view to "
"track :guilabel:`Remaining Quantity` and :guilabel:`Remaining Value` month "
"over month for each product. This can help identify slow-moving or aging "
"stock, such as perishable goods approaching the end of their shelf life."
msgstr ""
"Филтърът :guilabel:`Отчет за остаряване` е филтър в :ref:`Любими <inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/moves-analysis-search-options>`, който предварително "
"конфигурира обобщения изглед на :guilabel:`Анализ на движенията`, за да "
"проследява :guilabel:`Оставащо количество` и :guilabel:`Оставаща стойност` "
"месец по месец за всеки продукт. Това може да помогне за идентифициране на "
"бавнооборотни или остаряващи наличности, като например бързоразвалящи се "
"стоки с наближаващ край на срока на годност."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:208
msgid ""
"Select the Aging Report favorite filter from the Moves Analysis search bar."
msgstr ""
"Изберете любимия филтър „Отчет за остаряване“ от лентата за търсене на "
"„Анализ на движенията“."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:211
msgid "Applying this filter configures the pivot view as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Прилагането на този филтър конфигурира обобщения изглед по следния начин:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:213
msgid ""
"Rows are grouped by :guilabel:`Product Category`, then "
"by :guilabel:`Product`."
msgstr ""
"Редовете са групирани по :guilabel:`Категория на продукта`, след което "
"по :guilabel:`Продукт`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:214
msgid "Columns are grouped by :guilabel:`Month`."
msgstr "Колоните са групирани по :guilabel:`Месец`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:215
msgid ""
"Measures are set to :guilabel:`Remaining Quantity` and :guilabel:`Remaining "
"Value`."
msgstr ""
"Мерките са зададени на :guilabel:`Оставащо количество` и :guilabel:`Оставаща "
"стойност`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:217
msgid ""
"The Aging Report pivot table, grouped by product category and product, with "
"months as\n"
"columns."
msgstr ""
"Обобщената таблица на отчета за остаряване, групирана по продуктова "
"категория и продукт, с месеци като колони."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:222
msgid ""
"Because :doc:`consignment <../../shipping_receiving/daily_operations/"
"owned_stock>` and :doc:`dropshipping <../../shipping_receiving/"
"daily_operations/dropshipping>` products are not included in inventory "
"valuation, their stock movements do not appear in the :guilabel:`Aging "
"Report` filter."
msgstr ""
"Тъй като продуктите на :doc:`консигнация <../../shipping_receiving/"
"daily_operations/owned_stock>` и :doc:`директна доставка <../../"
"shipping_receiving/daily_operations/dropshipping>` не се включват в оценката "
"на складовите наличности, техните движения на склад не се появяват във "
"филтъра :guilabel:`Отчет за остаряване`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:5
msgid ""
"The *Moves History* report in Odoo **Inventory** provides a detailed record "
"of product movements (containing past and current locations), lot numbers, "
"and reasons for movement. Reports can be generated for any time frame, "
"making this report essential for analyzing stock levels, monitoring "
"inventory turnover, and identifying any discrepancies in inventory."
msgstr ""
"Отчетът *История на движенията* в Odoo *Inventory* предоставя подробен запис "
"на движенията на продуктите (съдържащ минали и текущи локации), номера на "
"партиди и причини за преместването. Отчети могат да бъдат генерирани за "
"произволен период от време, което прави този отчет съществен за анализиране "
"на нивата на наличност, наблюдение на обращаемостта на наличността и "
"идентифициране на евентуални разминавания в наличността."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:14
msgid ""
"To access the moves history report, go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Reporting --> Moves History`."
msgstr ""
"За достъп до отчета за история на движенията, отидете "
"на :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Отчитане --> История на движенията`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:17
msgid "Display Moves History report."
msgstr "Показване на отчета История на движенията."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:26
msgid "In the report, the columns represent:"
msgstr "В отчета колоните представляват:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:28
msgid ":guilabel:`Date`: calendar date and time of the stock move."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Дата`: календарната дата и час на движението на наличността."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:29
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reference`: description of the reason for the stock move or "
"quantity change, such as a receipt number (e.g. `WH/IN/00012`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Референция`: описание на причината за движението на наличността "
"или промяната в количеството, като номер на получаване (напр. `WH/IN/00012`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:31
msgid ":guilabel:`Product`: name of the product involved in the move."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Продукт`: името на продукта, участващ в движението."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Lot/Serial Number`: specifies the lot or serial number of the "
"tracked product being moved."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Партида/сериен номер`: посочва партидата или серийния номер на "
"проследявания продукт, който се премества."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:34
msgid ":guilabel:`From`: source location of the moved product."
msgstr ":guilabel:`От`: изходната локация на преместения продукт."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:35
msgid ":guilabel:`To`: destination location of the moved product."
msgstr ":guilabel:`До`: крайната локация на преместения продукт."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:36
msgid ":guilabel:`Quantity`: number of products moved."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Количество`: броят на преместените продукти."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:37
msgid ":guilabel:`Unit`: unit of measure of the products moved."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Unit`: мерна единица на преместените продукти."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:38
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Status`: indicates the move status, which can "
"be :guilabel:`Done`, :guilabel:`Available` (ready for action), "
"or :guilabel:`Partially Available` (insufficient quantities to complete the "
"operation)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Status`: показва статуса на движението, който може да "
"бъде :guilabel:`Done`, :guilabel:`Available` (готово за действие) "
"или :guilabel:`Partially Available` (недостатъчни количества за завършване "
"на операцията)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:45
msgid ""
"Use the following search options to customize the :guilabel:`Moves History` "
"report to display relevant information"
msgstr ""
"Използвайте следните опции за търсене, за да персонализирате "
"отчета :guilabel:`Moves History`, така че да показва съответната информация"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:50
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:69
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/reporting/delayed.rst:38
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:350
msgid "Filters"
msgstr "Филтри"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:52
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:71
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Filters` section allows users to search among pre-made and "
"custom filters to find specific stock records."
msgstr ""
"Разделът :guilabel:`Filters` позволява на потребителите да търсят сред "
"готови и персонализирани филтри, за да намерят конкретни записи за "
"наличности."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:55
msgid ""
":guilabel:`To Do`: show stock move records that are in progress. This "
"includes lines with a :guilabel:`Status` column value "
"of :guilabel:`Available` or :guilabel:`Partially Available`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`To Do`: показва записи за движение на наличности, които са в "
"процес на изпълнение. Това включва редове със стойност на "
"колоната :guilabel:`Status` :guilabel:`Available` или :guilabel:`Partially "
"Available`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:57
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Done`: completed stock moves, with a :guilabel:`Status` "
"of :guilabel:`Done`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Done`: завършени движения на наличности, "
"със :guilabel:`Status` :guilabel:`Done`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:58
msgid ":guilabel:`Incoming`: displays move records from vendor locations."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Incoming`: показва записи за движение от местоположения на "
"доставчици."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:59
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Outgoing`: displays move records to customer locations, including "
"customer returns."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Outgoing`: показва записи за движение към местоположения на "
"клиенти, включително клиентски връщания."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:61
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Internal`: displays move records from one internal location to "
"another."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Internal`: показва записи за движение от едно вътрешно "
"местоположение към друго."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:62
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manufacturing`: shows records where products were produced from "
"the virtual, production :doc:`location <../inventory_management/"
"use_locations>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Manufacturing`: показва записи, при които продуктите са "
"произведени от виртуалното производствено :doc:`местоположение <../"
"inventory_management/use_locations>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:64
msgid ":guilabel:`Scrapped`: shows records where products have been scrapped."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Бракувано`: показва записи, при които продуктите са били "
"бракувани."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:65
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Date`: select this drop-down menu to access various date filter "
"options and view stock moves from a specific month, quarter, or year."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Date`: изберете това падащо меню, за да получите достъп до "
"различни опции за филтриране по дата и да видите движения на наличности за "
"конкретен месец, тримесечие или година."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:67
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Last 30 Days`: show records that occurred in the last thirty days."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Last 30 Days`: показва записи, възникнали през последните "
"тридесет дни."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:68
msgid ":guilabel:`Last 3 Months`: show records from the last three months."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Last 3 Months`: показва записи от последните три месеца."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:70
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock.rst:110
msgid "Group By"
msgstr "Групиране по"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:75
msgid ":guilabel:`Product`: group records by product."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Product`: групира записите по продукт."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:76
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Status`: group records by the three status "
"types: :guilabel:`Done`, :guilabel:`Available`, and :guilabel:`Partially "
"Available`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Status`: групира записите по трите вида "
"статус: :guilabel:`Done`, :guilabel:`Available` и :guilabel:`Partially "
"Available`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:78
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Date`: group records "
"by :guilabel:`Year`, :guilabel:`Quarter`, :guilabel:`Month`, :guilabel:`Week`, "
"or :guilabel:`Day`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Date`: групира записите "
"по :guilabel:`Year`, :guilabel:`Quarter`, :guilabel:`Month`, :guilabel:`Week` "
"или :guilabel:`Day`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:80
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Transfers`: group records by operation number, e.g. `WH/OUT/"
"00012`, `WH/MO/00211`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Transfers`: групира записите по номер на операция, напр. `WH/OUT/"
"00012`, `WH/MO/00211`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:82
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Location`: group records by source location (the :guilabel:`From` "
"column in this report)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Location`: групира записите по местоположение на източника "
"(колоната :guilabel:`From` в този отчет)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:84
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Category`: group records by product category. To configure these, "
"go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Products: Product "
"Categories`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Category`: групира записите по категория на продукта. За да ги "
"конфигурирате, отидете на :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --"
"> Products: Product Categories`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_history.rst:86
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Batch Transfer`: group records by :doc:`batch <../../"
"shipping_receiving/picking_methods/batch>`."
