#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:180
msgid ""
"To partially complete the MO, see :ref:`Partially complete the MO "
"<manufacturing/basic_setup/partially-complete-mo>`."
msgstr ""
"За частично завършване на производствената поръчка вижте :ref:`Частично "
