msgstr ""
"**От главното табло на Odoo**: От главното табло на Odoo отворете "
"модула :menuselection:`Shop Floor`. Отваря се *Общ преглед*, показващ "
"работните поръчки за всички |MOs|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_production.rst:92
msgid "Registering partial production"
msgstr "Регистриране на частично производство"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_production.rst:94
msgid ""
"To process a work order where only a partial quantity is produced, click "
"the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` icon on the work "
"order card. Then, click :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Register Quantity / Lot` "
